  "translation": "Today is Saturday. I get up at eight in the morning. I eat an apple, then I read a book. The book is very interesting. At noon I go to a restaurant with my friend; we order rice and eggs. In the afternoon we go to the park; there are many flowers in the park, and the flowers are very beautiful. In the evening I return home. I wash my face, then I go to sleep. I play with my younger sister. She can sing, I cannot sing. We are very happy. I go to sleep at ten in the evening. Today is really fun. I like today very much."
